I would recommend here to handle the negative case first:
```
        $invoiceLogoPath = $this->getIdentityLogoHtml();
        if (!$invoiceLogoPath) {
            return null;
        }
        return sprintf(
            "%s%s%s",
            $this->_urlBuilder->getBaseUrl(['_type' => UrlInterface::URL_TYPE_MEDIA]),
            $this->getLogoBaseDir(),
            $invoiceLogoPath
        );
```
Such a code seems cleaner for me, and we got rid of `$result` variable.

But it's just a recommendation. Feel free to use your approach.

