Hi @Usik2203 . I see you are changing the message signatures to pass in context with the objective to check if cart belongs to a customer. Changing method signatures might also impact other plugins. Try limiting context to resolver level and using it in a plugin is probably not ideal. To get around this, $cart should have the customer related metadata
```
$cartCustomerId = (int)$cart->getCustomerId();

        /* Guest cart, allow operations */
        if (0 === $cartCustomerId && (null === $customerId || 0 === $customerId)) {
            return $cart;
        }
```
You can use the above.

