@orlangur thank you for noticing!

The idea was to call this `invalidateSize` in `\Magento\Framework\Data\Collection\AbstractDb::addFieldToFilter`,
in the same way as it's done for EAV collection:
`\Magento\Eav\Model\Entity\Collection\AbstractCollection::addAttributeToFilter`.

Probably I missed this point while performing the review.
@sergeynezbritskiy, could you please check it?

